@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050
@userId = 3

### Create: use the returned id below
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ana Perez","email":"ana@example.com","department":"HR"}

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?page=1&pageSize=20

### Get
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{userId}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ana Perez","email":"ana@example.com","department":"People"}

### Validation: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","email":"invalid","department":"HR"}

### Duplicate: 409 (after creating Ana)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Other","email":"ANA@example.com","department":"HR"}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{userId}}
